# Thieves Guild: Aengoth the Jeweler's jobs, The Rat In The Pot, Ald'ruhn (Aengoth = 054E3E00). Offered under
# "jobs" in a fixed order: Anareren's Devil Tanto (the job puts it in Anarenen's chest), Redoran Master Helm,
# Boethiah's Pillow Book, Withershins, scrap metal, Darts of Judgement.
# AddItem stands in for the thefts and finds; the tanto leaves the chest it was put in. Reputation: 5 each but the
# helm (its 5 goes to Redoran) and the darts (5 for all four) -- 25, 55 with Habasi's.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance --instance 2 mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_a1_11_report --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case tg_devil_tanto
run
player->PositionCell 171 500 -256 0 "Ald-ruhn, The Rat In The Pot"
until 300 GetPCCell "Ald-ruhn, The Rat In The Pot" == 1
approach 054E3E00
talk aengoth
ask jobs
ask Anareren's Devil Tanto
expect GetJournalIndex TG_LootAldruhnMG == 10
bye
run
"chest_small_02_anararen"->RemoveItem devil_tanto_tgamg 1
player->AddItem devil_tanto_tgamg 1
approach 054E3E00
talk aengoth
ask Anareren's Devil Tanto
choose 4
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex TG_LootAldruhnMG == 100
bye
end

case tg_master_helm
approach 054E3E00
talk aengoth
ask jobs
ask Redoran Master Helm
expect GetJournalIndex TG_MasterHelm == 10
bye
run
player->AddItem redoran_master_helm 1
approach 054E3E00
talk aengoth
ask Redoran Master Helm
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex TG_MasterHelm == 100
bye
end

case tg_bad_gandosa
approach 054E3E00
talk aengoth
ask jobs
ask Boethiah's Pillow Book
expect GetJournalIndex TG_BadGandosa == 10
bye
run
player->AddItem bk_BoethiahPillowBook 1
approach 054E3E00
talk aengoth
ask Boethiah's Pillow Book
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex TG_BadGandosa == 100
bye
end

case tg_withershins
approach 054E3E00
talk aengoth
ask jobs
ask Withershins
expect GetJournalIndex TG_Withershins == 10
bye
run
player->AddItem BookSkill_Restoration1 1
approach 054E3E00
talk aengoth
ask Withershins
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex TG_Withershins == 100
bye
end

case tg_scrap_metal
approach 054E3E00
talk aengoth
ask jobs
ask scrap metal
expect GetJournalIndex TG_AldruhnDefenses == 10
bye
run
player->AddItem Ingred_Scrap_Metal_01 4
approach 054E3E00
talk aengoth
ask scrap metal
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex TG_AldruhnDefenses == 100
bye
end

case tg_darts
approach 054E3E00
talk aengoth
ask jobs
ask Darts of Judgement
expect GetJournalIndex TG_DartsJudgement == 10
bye
run
player->AddItem dart_uniq_judgement 4
approach 054E3E00
talk aengoth
ask Darts of Judgement
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex TG_DartsJudgement == 100
bye
end

# 55 reputation meets rank 5 (Bandit: 45), not 6 (60).
case tg_aengoth_advancement
approach 054E3E00
talk aengoth
ask Advancement
ask Advancement
expect player->GetPCRank "Thieves Guild" == 5
bye
end
